  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conservation of the 14th-Century Patriarchate Monastery in Pe (Peja)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Built in the 14th century, the Patriarchate is one of the oldest monasteries in the region and an important historical site for Kosovos Serb population. This project, which involves environmental monitoring of the interior, directly supports the Embassy&apos;s efforts to promote regional stability by reducing inter-ethnic tensions and economic growth by increasing domestic and regional tourism.</narrative>
  </description>
